  "text": "### How to Describe It to Customers  \n**Simple Explanation:**\n\"SmartSaver is a savings account where your money earns interest every month. You can withdraw anytime with no penalties, and our rates are among the best available.\"  \n**Detailed Explanation:**\n\"You deposit money in your SmartSaver account. Every month, we calculate interest based on your balance and the current rate, then add it directly to your account. Your rate moves with the Bank of England base rate, so it adjusts automatically each month. There are no monthly fees, no withdrawal restrictions, and no minimum balance.\"",
